{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f6e56cb5cc191178a2e139690d529efe74147731229c2eb45a80606cdb2fafd2", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのオーディションは、\n今日も順調に進んでいる。さて……）", "zh": "（39PROJECT的成员甄选今天也进行得十分顺利。\n接下来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "238533cea834b18364cc3b3110e88a030bae87bd13d923dccc0bfd218f05ccc7", "ja": "それでは次の方、どうぞ。", "zh": "那么下一位请进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "1be8241eca0a5168f0b5455880ac03b824194b11540eed46700a490b6b821b87", "ja": "はいっ！\nし……ししし、失礼しますっ！", "zh": "是的！\n打……打打打，打扰了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "820aca32270be4858939a4bc93959f75a5b05ab458a983394f496a38c757042c", "ja": "ふ、ふぉぉぉぉ……！\nここが、神聖なるオーディション会場……！", "zh": "唔、唔喔喔喔喔……！\n这里就是神圣的甄选会场……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "0b338661f897a7fd3a12deea5d5c4167f265ef682025177d4ca1e3a8220d9dd4", "ja": "765プロのアイドルちゃん達が、この空気を\n味わっていたのかと思うと……胸熱です……！", "zh": "一想到765艺能的偶像宝贝们曾呼吸过这里的空气……\n就好激动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "efa2fdb968409fe6843c0c91c780fe1d758ccf288bc5d10390dce035d36dc40f", "ja": "君？　とりあえず、自己紹介をお願いできるかな？", "zh": "同学？能请你先自我介绍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "8409c509d13c6a89d7e03cac8e04b9c85dd137a26867a15d7c31064d5a7146c5", "ja": "ハッ！？　し、失礼しました！", "zh": "啊！？失、失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "5767aee594ec678c74be6cb4f2eef8a5acad80cd9d2ea8ba4f68d5774dea5eab", "ja": "あの、ありさ……松田亜利沙といいます！\n今日は、よろしくお願いいたしますっ！", "zh": "那个，亚利沙的名字……叫松田亚利沙！\n今天请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "70678a0b2dbfa46e5b028a077c52ff53a69b629b81f9f5fda4c1da74f384eb21", "ja": "松田さんだね、こちらこそよろしく。", "zh": "松田小姐是吗？彼此彼此，请多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ee2e1d87a3dc273217bfece313d4da70157d8dcdc121a6f596795269d5f87218", "ja": "それじゃ、さっそく質問させてもらうけど……\n君はどうして、アイドルになりたいと思ったのかな？", "zh": "那么，马上来问你几个问题吧……\n你为什么会想当偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "5c12f83213767799bc7c09f45ce07df6d309703e5d1b54dd9341177bdb3a14c6", "ja": "はい！　ありさは……\nありさは、アイドルちゃんが大好きなんです！", "zh": "是！因为亚利沙……\n亚利沙最喜欢偶像宝贝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1cc1d5ed8b59b57434e0db2d47410b29de25a923ab9fa121079463401f8c3c08", "ja": "アイドル……ちゃん？", "zh": "偶像……宝贝？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "fb72aac54cbef468488d8090b0886bc67804c57dba2a294f90f1bbb4d4b89438", "ja": "はいっ♪　もともとは、ありさのお父さんが、\nアイドルちゃんファンで……。", "zh": "是啊♪\n亚利沙的爸爸原本就是偶像宝贝的粉丝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "f4aefda8329bf3c63d0868c5e8791e2e1d39a3e1693674503b2285776b0e177e", "ja": "小さいころから、よくコンサートに\n連れていってもらってたんです！", "zh": "从亚利沙小的时候，\n爸爸就常带亚利沙去演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "b53a4dc7a077c4e3c5645e23a9eac806104ac16cbc5d0f93361c8e49a8e60091", "ja": "それで、ステージでキラキラ輝くアイドルちゃん達を\n見ているうちに、お近づきになりたくなって～……。", "zh": "然后一直看着在舞台上闪闪发光的偶像宝贝们，\n亚利沙就想接近她们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "ae776655fc249e26f96053fa34928a76133ea7b291883bf8f60a9f6d3842bcd6", "ja": "ではなく！　……ありさも、アイドルちゃん達みたいに\nキラキラ輝けたらって、思うようになったんですっ！", "zh": "不！\n……亚利沙也开始想和像偶像宝贝们一样闪闪发光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b5177c83e62f039a3ff0eaa14f65eeed331d10b5c19683494ceab1a4f292f866", "ja": "（なんだか少し、変わった子みたいだけど……\n好きなもののことを話す表情は、すごく輝いてるな）", "zh": "（这孩子似乎有点特别……\n但她谈到喜欢的东西时的表情，非常耀眼呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "329406db5f35801f4ab10352b00fca18f81fe85e5d509946fbd3dc5449cba2a4", "ja": "アイドルに造詣が深いのは、よくわかりました。\n具体的に、どんなアイドルになりたいとかあるかな？", "zh": "看来你在接触偶像这块有很深的底子。\n具体而言，你想当什么样的偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "44a40f3d391062826e6a526f9cdbfc83ca0b703fa570f37c186bb0ebfd9dc4e9", "ja": "ふえっ！？\nあ、ありさがなりたいアイドルちゃん像、ですか……？", "zh": "唔欸！？\n亚、亚利沙想当的偶像宝贝类型吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "9c96811632e9233a1ee81d8c5f6e98b0619955ab9bd71dea1887f2766b9f5f00", "ja": "ムムム……　それはアイドルオタク的にも、\n難しい問題です。命題と言っても過言ではありません！", "zh": "唔唔唔……这对偶像宅来说也是难题。\n说是逻辑命题也不为过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "675f83880f9d051b05a00db6439f2df43618bf2a43f1e9dbc845a70880e4181d", "ja": "何故なら、『理想のアイドルちゃん』像と\n『好きなアイドルちゃん』とは、別物だからで……！", "zh": "毕竟『理想的偶像宝贝形象』和\n『喜欢的偶像宝贝』是不一样的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1021_p", "source_sha256": "68ac69682e060eafdef91c38800cc40ebe048d9cf6ec5d3831261ac22a6770c6", "ja": "そ、そうか。でも、難しく考える必要はないよ。\nたとえば、君はどんなアイドルを見ていたいと思う？", "zh": "是、是吗？但不用想得太复杂啦。\n比如说，你想看什么样的偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "0147657cfb860f52d9601fb1167e52bb8fa74e1e63de16e375b2c21d4e9dddb5", "ja": "ありさが見ていたいアイドルちゃんですか？\nええっと……。", "zh": "亚利沙想看的偶像宝贝吗？\n呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "b11a1ea592765d391c30e36882e41dcbb0bbb1ee5d703df7bfd3877bd4151e15", "ja": "それはやっぱり、\n可愛くて、なんだかキラキラしてて……。", "zh": "那当然是既可爱又闪闪发光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1024_p", "source_sha256": "bb33c01591e5f7149c374a7ce748c61bbc3be4307b759fe4530d1b86fec15aba", "ja": "うんうん。", "zh": "嗯嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "398680dd49c16a77b49a4351d4ef9abf345ab9c14c64ec009d2d721bb289ad8d", "ja": "それから見てると楽しくて、元気が出て！\nあっ、あと一生懸命で、応援したくなるっていうかっ！", "zh": "还有就是看着就会很开心，让人涌现活力！\n啊，还有很拚命努力，让人想帮忙加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "9afabb842a2f42604884b5d62e5876ddb7d5137c516f9f3dcdfb2062dd877528", "ja": "とにかく、幸せな気持ちにさせてくれる……\nそういうアイドルちゃんですっ！", "zh": "总之就是会带给人幸福感觉……\n的那种偶像宝贝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a19ccae063bf3e14f1d1a3e0050c8fe951aa691e0908dee0b05a4aeb6bdb61c4", "ja": "（見る人の心に突き刺さる、まっすぐな言葉と笑顔だ。\nやっぱり、この子は……）", "zh": "（她率直的言语及笑容，能打动旁人的心。\n果然这孩子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_1028", "source_sha256": "8a074090ba746c3d14eaa8f89bee9c17223b9fb56c27e59eba57fa354f0377d9", "ja": "アイドルの素質を\n持ってる！", "zh": "具备偶像的素质！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "71083286f20d28db694e49be873cd4aa714ec553d518f3ab7ad1c1a7688a0d5c", "ja": "松田亜利沙さん、合格だ！\nこれから、一緒に頑張っていこう。", "zh": "松田亚利沙小姐，你被录取了！\n今后我们一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_2001_028ari", "source_sha256": "bd615455de659b72c96efa8d829a84046a3f487724a98789684332d521422a53", "ja": "ふええっ！？　ほ、本当ですか！？\nありさが、アイドルちゃんに……！？", "zh": "唔欸欸！？你、你是说真的吗！？\n亚利沙，要成为偶像宝贝了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_2002_028ari", "source_sha256": "53df0ecc6205b7440e4e875460750b7f6a533777007fe800ce6180fc767cd052", "ja": "や、やりました～！\nプロデューサーさん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "太、太好了～！\n制作人先生，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_2003_028ari", "source_sha256": "d9ea8c46f1dcb761ed9f8234e3b5ff85cc12377af69fd2a9916830c8c42a482a", "ja": "ありさは、アイドルちゃんの名を汚さないためにも！\nこれから一生懸命頑張りますよ～！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "亚利沙为了不玷污偶像宝贝之名！\n今后会拚命努力的～！唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "5e6e50993a12ecfa2d55f9b129f81eb8991e5b8d7af26d794d2db9f0fba442bd", "ja": "（アイドルの魅力をよく知っていて、\nファンとしての気持ちも理解できる……）", "zh": "（她既清楚偶像的魅力，\n也能理解粉丝的心情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "7e82a17998ebdf63382200e2146ef8c8faa2a7cad36e0e9e60c1685625c20a69", "ja": "（それは、アイドルとして必ず武器になるはずだ！\nしっかりと育てていこう）", "zh": "（这些在当偶像时一定会成为武器的！\n我要好好培育她。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
